{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>After Elohim made known to you all this.</b> All this wisdom — you said, 'let Pharaoh seek a discerning and wise man.'" "<b>There is none so discerning and wise as you.</b> Since the interpretation had settled in their hearts, and in all these words of his a counsel of wisdom was embedded, the matter was in their eyes as though everything had already come to pass. Therefore he said 'after He made known' in the past tense."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:19:30.512076378Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}